WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.100
Choose the picture you want to crop.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.190
Pick a shape, such as Square, or crop freely.

3
00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:10.620
Drag the frame or its corners to choose what to keep.

4
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:13.020
When it looks right, click Save.

5
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:16.630
Your cropped picture is ready. Click Save to keep it.

6
00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.030
The picture never left your device.
